    description: Some("Your dragon blows bubbles to trap the monsters in each cave, then bursts them before they wriggle free and come after you. Bubbles carry him too: hop aboard and float up to secret rooms. The screen scrolls around him rather than holding a whole round at once, and its top and bottom edges join, so a fall drops you back in above."),
